### Check first
Open [this component](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/highlights) and its [metrics](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/metrics). Compare time to first token, prompt length, prefill work and queue depth. The configured threshold is **{{threshold}}** in the monitor chart's unit.

### Likely causes
Large prompts, a busy queue or slow prefill.

### Fix
Reduce unnecessary prompt context, tune batching and address the measured capacity bottleneck.

### Verify
P99 time to first token returns below the budget under representative traffic. If samples are absent, investigate the exporter and Collector: this threshold check cannot establish healthy operation without data.
